sequenceDiagram
    actor Driver
    participant GW as API Gateway
    
    participant S as System
    
    note over Driver, S: Complete or Reject a Delivery
    Driver->>GW: Complete or Reject Delivery { orderId, status, signatureUrl }
    GW->>S: update delivery (role: driver)
    S-->>GW: Delivery status updated
    GW-->>Driver: Delivery status updated

    par Updates dispatched in parallel
        S-->>S: update delivery status { orderId, status, signatureUrl? }
    and
        S-->>Driver: delivery_status { orderId, deliveryStatus }
    end

    note over Driver, GW: Validation Errors
    alt role is not driver
        GW-->>Driver: Only drivers can complete deliveries
    else missing orderId or status
        GW-->>Driver: orderId and status are required
    else invalid status value
        GW-->>Driver: status must be completed or rejected
    else completed but no signatureUrl
        GW-->>Driver: signatureUrl required for completed deliveries
    end